# Note on what is deliberately NOT ignored: native/Resources/ stays tracked.
# CMakeLists.txt lists every file in Resources/library and Resources/branding as
# a binary resource of the plugin target, so a checkout without them cannot
# configure. The six library .wav files are synthesised found-sound sources with
# deterministic seeds - README.md §"factory library" - not the commercial VRAC+
# recordings, and the fonts are IBM Plex and Barlow Condensed under SIL OFL 1.1.
